a) $\widehat{BJK}=\widehat{BDG};\widehat{BKJ}=\widehat{BGD}$;

b) $\widehat{DMG}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{DBG};\widehat{GMB}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{GDB};\widehat{BMD}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{BGD}$.
