Suy ra $\widehat{DMG}=\widehat{JMK}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{JBK}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{DBG}$.\\
Tương tự, ta có $\widehat{GMB}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{GDB};\widehat{BMD}=180^{\circ}-\widehat{BGD}$.
}\end{ex}

